--- !u!114 &1399455090
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1399455084}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 49d2628479ebcbb48aa622ef735ee465, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  tutorialTextDisplay: {fileID: 1165262081}
  uiRoot: {fileID: 452556141}
  alwaysFaceCamera: 1
  followDistance: 1.2
  followHeightOffset: -0.1
  faceCameraLerpSpeed: 5
  autoAdvanceDelay: 8
  bringTutorialToFront: 1
  frontSortingOrder: 500
  mandatoryConfiguredInputAcceptDelay: 2
  steps:
  - stepText: Welcome to the VR Microscopy Laboratory.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 0
    acceptedButtons: 
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 0
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  - stepText: Push the left controller thumbstick upward to move forward.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 1
    acceptedButtons: 09000000
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 1
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  - stepText: Push the left controller thumbstick downward to move backward.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 1
    acceptedButtons: 0a000000
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 1
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  - stepText: Push the left controller thumbstick to the left to move left.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 1
    acceptedButtons: 0b000000
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 1
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  - stepText: Push the left controller thumbstick to the right to move right.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 1
    acceptedButtons: 0c000000
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 1
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  - stepText: In addition to thumbstick locomotion, you can press the grip button
      on the right controller to teleport.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 1
    acceptedButtons: 08000000
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 2
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  - stepText: This allows you to move to the position indicated by the right-hand
      laser pointer. You may try this after the tutorial is complete.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 0
    acceptedButtons: 
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 0
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  - stepText: Well done. You have mastered the basic movement controls.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 0
    acceptedButtons: 
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 0
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  - stepText: Push the right controller thumbstick to the left to rotate your view
      to the left.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 1
    acceptedButtons: 0f000000
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 1
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  - stepText: Push the right controller thumbstick to the right to rotate your view
      to the right.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 1
    acceptedButtons: 10000000
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 1
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  - stepText: In addition to rotating with the right thumbstick, you may physically
      turn your body to adjust your viewing direction.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 0
    acceptedButtons: 
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 0
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  - stepText: Excellent. You have mastered view rotation.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 0
    acceptedButtons: 
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 0
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  - stepText: Congratulations. You have completed the basic controls tutorial.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 0
    acceptedButtons: 
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 0
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  - stepText: Press the Y button on the left controller to open the tutorial menu
      and select any tutorial to review.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 1
    acceptedButtons: 02000000
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 2
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  - stepText: Use the right controller thumbstick to select a tutorial, then press
      the A button on the right controller to confirm.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 0
    acceptedButtons: 
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 2
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  - stepText: Select the X button in the upper-right corner to close the menu. Then
      move near the confocal microscope to continue the experiment.
    isMandatoryInteraction: 0
    acceptedButtons: 
    requireHoldButtonCombo: 0
    requiredHeldButton: 0
    inputAccessMode: 2
    onStepStart:
      m_PersistentCalls:
        m_Calls: []
    customUIAnchor: {fileID: 0}
  onTutorialStart:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  onTutorialFinish:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls:
      - m_Target: {fileID: 574288201}
        m_TargetAssemblyTypeName: MandatoryTutorialTrigger, Assembly-CSharp
        m_MethodName: CompleteTutorial
        m_Mode: 1
        m_Arguments:
          m_ObjectArgument: {fileID: 0}
          m_ObjectArgumentAssemblyTypeName: UnityEngine.Object, UnityEngine
          m_IntArgument: 0
          m_FloatArgument: 0
          m_StringArgument: 
          m_BoolArgument: 0
        m_CallState: 2
  onWrongAction:
    m_PersistentCalls:
      m_Calls: []
  errorDisplayDuration: 1.5
  inputAccessConfigVersion: 1
